## Description

Kubrick 0.2.0 rewrites the core as a provider-agnostic agentic coding CLI in the style of Claude Code. It is tuned first for local models (Ollama, vLLM, llama.cpp, LM Studio) and also supports Anthropic, OpenAI, Amazon Bedrock (commercial and GovCloud), and Triton. The release also adds an interactive terminal UI, encrypted credential storage, a `kubrick update` command, and a contained dev environment, and fixes CI/security workflow issues. The full list is in the `CHANGELOG.md` 0.2.0 section.

